# Copy to .env (or .env.local) and fill in (agents cannot write .env files; the owner does this by hand).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are baked into the JS bundle at BUILD time: place the file in apps/mobile of the
# checkout you build the release APK from. Leave both empty for the pure offline demo (no network calls).
# https only. The anon key is public by design; never put the service-role key or the Anthropic key here.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
